<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T2.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S3.T2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Image generation and captioning benchmarks after multimodal pretraining.<span id="S3.T2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We find that mixed-modal training consistently improves performance. <sup id="S3.T2.10.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S3.T2.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>Evaluated using official open-source model weights. Highlighting denotes best results across all models.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
