<span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">[CFG 1.0:]</span> A table topped with a variety of toy animals, including a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">giraffe</span>, a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">cow</span>, and a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">bird</span>, as well as a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFDFDF;">toy duck</span>. In the background, <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.2.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">there is a frame attached to the wall.</span></span>
<br class="ltx_break ltx_align_left">
<span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">[CFG 1.5:]</span> A <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">green</span> table topped with toy animals, including a giraffe, a cow, a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">yellow</span> bird, and a toy duck, next to a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFD8F7;">red box</span>. In the background, there is a <span id="A1.F16.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.3.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFDFDF;">photo</span> frame attached to the wall.</span>
